WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Store: read evidence before changing packing
The parcel retains its handoff evidence even if an editable status
changes. The test notice means no live carrier action occurred. Packing
does not collect COD or advance the whole order.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Vendor: distinguish quantities from parcel permissions
This existing handoff cannot be adopted into a new vendor packing plan
or voided as unused. Separately permitted parcel actions may still
appear. The test marker stays visible.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Platform: inspect without changing the record
Admin oversight shows the same retained evidence and test marker. This
screen provides no save, seal, void or parcel-creation commands. One
parcel observation does not prove all purchased units were delivered.
